TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Duvarlarımın biraz dokunuşa ihtiyacı var,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Hayır, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}hayır{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}! Duvar kâğıdı değil.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Duvara asılacak bir şey.
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Hani, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}asma raf ya da duvar aksesuarı gibi.
{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Aslında {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}duvarı şık gösterecek her şey olur.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Yani {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}öyle bir şey bulursan{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} getirir misin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
olur mu,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Say, I'm wondering if you'll help me
with my home décor, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
I'm looking for something.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}oh, I don't know, something that
looks nice with everything else
in my room.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Now, I'll leave everything to you.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Find something that's simply
perfect for me, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}OK?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Di' un po', {{TAG:0005:0008:}}...
Come te la cavi ad arredare?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Sto cercando qualcosa di... di.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Oh, non lo so neanche io.
L'importante è che non stoni
con il resto dell'arredamento.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ti lascio carta bianca.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Devi solo trovare l'oggetto
perfetto per me! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Che ci vorrà mai?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Şey, ev dekorasyonunda bana yardım
eder misin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Bir şey arıyorum{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}bilemiyorum, odadaki diğer her şeyle
güzel duracak bir parça.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Seçimi sana bırakıyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Benim için kusursuz bir şey bul, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}olur mu?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I've been having a hard time
redecorating my house,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}I just need a certain something.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}But I'm just NOT sure what it is.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} could you possibly find
something for me, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Yes,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} please find me something that
will make my home décor great
again,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Meinen Wänden fehlt noch das
gewisse Etwas, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Nein, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}keine Tapete!
Etwas zum Aufhängen, meine ich.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ein Hängeregal oder etwas in dieser
Art.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Etwas Geschmackvolles eben.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Wenn du etwas findest, würdest
du es mir dann bitte vorbeibringen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

